<title>BELGIUM: PetroFina issue raises 2.094 bln bfr.</title>
<headline>PetroFina issue raises 2.094 bln bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian oil group PetroFina said on Friday the exercise of its 1994/97 share warrant issue, which closed on June 4, raised 2.094 billion Belgian francs of new capital through the issue of 167,569 new shares.</p>
<p>The new stock, each accompanied by a VVPR strip (reduced tax) coupon, will be listed from June 12. Holders had needed 20 warrants to entitle them to one share.</p>
<p>The exercise raises the number of issued PetroFina shares to 23,420,432.</p>
<p>The VVPR strip is separately tradeable.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
